	"name": "Driving Shot",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/ammunition/arrow-broadhead-glowing-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Your accuracy and your knowledge of a creature’s center of gravity afford you an incredible ability to use ranged attacks to push enemies away by striking them just so. When you hit with a ranged attack against a target within your normal range, you can force them to make a Dexterity saving throw as a reaction. On a failed save, a medium or smaller target is pushed up to 15ft away from you. Large and larger targets are only moved 5ft.</p>",
